      {
        "id": 201188,
        "name": "Referee",
        "username": "Referee",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/c5a1d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-04T04:30:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe we don't want a full language, and of course they're low-tech, which simplifies things, but yeah, too ambitious on some other aspects... Though having four people learn the language and play the game in Dahan would be awesome.</p><p>A small hint I take (which might as well not be the intention, but you gotta grab those things while you can), is that given the spirit names are full sentences or fragments, it implies some sort of agglutinative language. ;)</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
