        "created_at": "2017-08-05T01:01:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’ve put my college linguistics classes to use constructing a language, and a short vocabulary in a couple others to label a map. For the more developed language, I went so far as to write a perl script to randomly generate words.</p>\n<p>Speaking of that, we can always just take the Dahan phoneme inventory and stick it in <a href=\"http://vulgarlang.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">vulgarlang.com</a>!</p>\n<p>(I know it sounds fishy, but it’s an excellent conlang generator.)</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
