        "raw": "I've put my college linguistics classes to use constructing a language, and a short vocabulary in a couple others to label a map. For the more developed language, I went so far as to write a perl script to randomly generate words.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSpeaking of that, we can always just take the Dahan phoneme inventory and stick it in vulgarlang.com!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n(I know it sounds fishy, but it's an excellent conlang generator.)",
